==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|frm}} {{term|queu}}, {{term|cueue}} et al., and from Modern French {{term|queue}}. This word is an example of a French word borrowed from English

===Verb===
{{en-verb|enqueues|'''[[enqueuing]]''' ''or'' '''[[enqueueing]]'''|enqueued}}
#{{transitive|computing}} To add an [[item]] to a [[queue]].

